# TecDoc harvester output — runtime-generated data, not source. Was previously
# tracked, which meant every `git reset --hard` deploy silently wiped out the
# harvester's accumulated work back to whatever snapshot was last committed.
# Persisted instead via a read-write bind mount (docker-compose.yml).
backend/src/oil-finder/clean-catalog-hierarchy.json
oil-finder-full-dataset/clean-catalog-hierarchy.json
